							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId1}}",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"todos",
								"{{todoId1}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "Update a todo item to mark it as completed.\n\n**Request Body (Partial Update):**\n```json\n{\n  \"completed\": true\n}\n```\n\n**Expected Response:**\n- Status: 200 OK\n- Body: Updated todo object\n\n**Notes:**\n- Supports partial updates (can update only title or completed)\n- Original fields are preserved if not included in request\n\n**Error Cases:**\n- 404 Not Found: Todo ID doesn't exist\n- 400 Bad Request: Invalid JSON format"
					},
					"response": []
				},
